---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Writing
description: Benedict Steele's writing, on this site and on LinkedIn.
tags: []
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
permalink: /writing/
---

{% if collections.writing.length %}
<div class="writing-list">
{% for group in collections.writing | reverse | groupByYear %}
  <h2 class="writing-list-year">{{ group[0] }}</h2>
  <ul class="collection-list-reset">
  {% for entry in group[1] %}
    <li class="writing-list-entry">
      <h3><a href="{{ entry.url }}">{{ entry.data.title }}</a></h3>
      <p class="meta">{{ entry.data.date | readableDate }}</p>
      {% if entry.data.summary %}<p class="summary">{{ entry.data.summary }}</p>{% endif %}
    </li>
  {% endfor %}
  </ul>
{% endfor %}
</div>

<p>Older pieces are on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/benedictsteele/recent-activity/articles/">LinkedIn</a>.</p>
{% else %}
<p>For now, my writing lives on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/benedictsteele/recent-activity/articles/">LinkedIn</a>.</p>
{% endif %}
